One final practical point: test the Office Script manually in Excel first with four sample Base64 signatures. Once the script successfully places the images at C45, G45, I45, and J45, connect it to Power Automate. This separates Excel/Office Script problems from Power Automate problems and makes troubleshooting much easier.
